---
/**
 * Make your own: aliases, keys, links, Shortcuts, programs, and recording (early). Each tile does one small thing when
 * you touch it, and the features that are not yet checked on a real Mac carry the Early tag.
 */
import Window from './Window.astro';

const link = 'apropos://run?command=up&text=hello%20world';
---
<section id="yours" class="section yours" aria-labelledby="yours-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 id="yours-title" class="claim">Make your own commands.</h2>
      <p class="lede">
        A link, a Shortcut or a program becomes a row in the list, with its own name, alias and key. It asks before its
        first run, and it can say what it needs, like selected text.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bento">
      <article class="b b-alias">
        <h3>Give it a short name</h3>
        <p class="alias-demo" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="typed-alias">up</span>
          <span class="alias-row"><span class="alias-pill">up</span> UPPERCASE</span>
        </p>
        <p>Type the alias and your command comes first, whatever else matches.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="b b-key">
        <h3>Give it a key</h3>
        <div class="keys" data-keys aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="cap">&#8963;</span><span class="cap">&#8997;</span><span class="cap">U</span>
        </div>
        <p>A global shortcut runs it from any app. A key that macOS, the panel or another command already uses is flagged.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="b b-link">
        <h3>Run it from a link</h3>
        <div class="link-row">
          <code>{link}</code>
          <button class="copy" type="button" data-copy={link}>Copy</button>
        </div>
        <p>Links run the commands you allow, from a Raycast quicklink, Alfred or any script. Shortcuts has a Run Apropos Command action for the same commands.</p>
      </article>

    </div>

    <div class="desk" data-desk>
      <div class="desk-wins" aria-hidden="false">
        <div class="w-review" data-drift="-0.06"><Window id="recording-review" width={500} /></div>
        <div class="w-alias" data-drift="0.05"><Window id="alias-popover" width={600} /></div>
      </div>
      <div class="desk-text">
        <div class="note">
          <h3>Record it once <span class="early">Early</span></h3>
          <p>
            Choose Record and use the menus of any app. Stop with Control-Option-Command-R. The review lists every step in
            plain words with how sturdy it is, tries each one against the apps without pressing anything, and saves it as
            a command. Typed text is never recorded.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="note">
          <h3>Keys for any menu item <span class="early">Early</span></h3>
          <p>
            Command-K on a menu item gives it an alias and a shortcut of its own. One key can serve items in different
            apps, since it runs the item of the app in front.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .bento {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .b {
    display: grid;
    align-content: start;
    gap: 18px;
    padding: clamp(22px, 2.6vw, 32px);
    border-radius: var(--r-frame);
    background: var(--card);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--line);
  }
  .b h3 {
    font-size: 21px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.022em;
  }
  .b p {
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .b-alias {
    grid-column: span 4;
  }
  .b-key {
    grid-column: span 4;
  }
  .b-link {
    grid-column: span 4;
  }

  .alias-demo {
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 14px;
    border-radius: var(--r-box);
    background: var(--paper-2);
  }
  .typed-alias {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .typed-alias::after {
    content: '';
    display: inline-block;
    width: 2px;
    height: 1.05em;
    margin-left: 2px;
    vertical-align: -0.15em;
    background: var(--mint);
  }
  .alias-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .alias-pill {
    padding: 1px 8px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--mint-wash);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .keys {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 6px 0;
  }
  .cap {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    border-radius: 11px;
    background: var(--key);
    color: var(--key-ink);
    box-shadow:
      0 0 0 1px var(--line-2),
      0 4px 0 var(--key-edge);
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition:
      transform 90ms var(--ease),
      box-shadow 90ms var(--ease);
  }
  .b-key:hover .cap,
  .keys:global(.down) .cap {
    transform: translateY(3px);
    box-shadow:
      0 0 0 1px var(--line-2),
      0 1px 0 var(--key-edge);
  }
  .b-key:hover .cap:nth-child(2) {
    transition-delay: 40ms;
  }
  .b-key:hover .cap:nth-child(3) {
    transition-delay: 80ms;
  }

  .link-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 10px 10px 10px 14px;
    border-radius: var(--r-box);
    background: var(--paper-2);
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .link-row code {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .copy {
    flex: none;
    min-height: 36px;
    padding: 0 14px;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--card);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--line-2);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  @media (max-width: 1000px) {
    .b-alias,
    .b-key {
      grid-column: span 6;
    }
    .b-link {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .b-alias,
    .b-key {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
  }
  /* Two real windows overlapping like on a desktop, drifting apart a little as the page scrolls. */
  .desk {
    margin-top: clamp(56px, 7vw, 104px);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 7fr) minmax(0, 5fr);
    gap: clamp(32px, 5vw, 72px);
    align-items: center;
  }
  .desk-wins {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 1.12;
  }
  .w-review {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    width: 66%;
    transform: translateY(var(--drift, 0px));
  }
  .w-alias {
    position: absolute;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 74%;
    transform: translateY(var(--drift, 0px));
  }
  .desk-text {
    display: grid;
    gap: 36px;
  }
  .note {
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .note h3 {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }
  .note p {
    color: var(--ink-2);
    max-width: 44ch;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .desk {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .desk-wins {
      aspect-ratio: 0.95;
    }
  }
</style>
